{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CpEAgYiM3mkbV9Khmsf51w","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Y Combinator most recent batch companies list AI startups\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"getcoai.com\",\"url\":\"https://getcoai.com/?p=86274\"},{\"title\":\"CO/AI Subscribe\",\"url\":\"https://getcoai.com/news/eggs-basket-y-combinators-summer-2025-batch-hits-record-with-nearly-100-ai-focus/\"},{\"title\":\"about.getcoai.com\",\"url\":\"https://about.getcoai.com/?p=86274\"},{\"title\":\"Artificial intelligence Startups Venture\",\"url\":\"https://news.crunchbase.com/venture/y-combinator-winter-2023-shift-ai-devtools-b2b/\"},{\"title\":\"What Y Combinator Is Funding in 2026: A Data Breakdown of 208 Startups\",\"url\":\"https://pinggy.io/amp/blog/what_yc_is_funding_in_2026/\"},{\"title\":\"tags.getcoai.com\",\"url\":\"https://tags.getcoai.com/?p=86274\"},{\"title\":\"what yc is funding in 2026\",\"url\":\"https://pinggy.io/blog/what_yc_is_funding_in_2026/\"},{\"title\":\"three quarters of founders in the latest y combinator cohort are working on\",\"url\":\"https://www.sherwood.news/tech/three-quarters-of-founders-in-the-latest-y-combinator-cohort-are-working-on/\"},{\"title\":\"ai startups now represent 75 of y combinators summer 2024 cohort\",\"url\":\"https://getcoai.com/news/ai-startups-now-represent-75-of-y-combinators-summer-2024-cohort\"},{\"title\":\"ww.getcoai.com\",\"url\":\"https://ww.getcoai.com/?p=86274\"}]\n\nThe most recent data I found is a August 11, 2026 analysis of YC's public directory. It lists 208 companies across the three most recent batches: Summer 2026, Fall 2026, and Winter 2027. The author's main finding is that AI now runs through nearly every company rather than being a separate category, and robotics and physical-world companies now match AI infrastructure company-for-company. That analysis is from a third-party blog, so I'd treat its numbers as secondary.\n\nI didn't find an actual company-by-company list for these batches, so the directory itself on YC's site is the place to check names.\n\nFor earlier context, a CO/AI article reported that 154 out of 170 startups in the Summer 2025 batch focused on AI. An older Sherwood News piece found that 156 or 75% of the S24 startups were working on AI-related products.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cb701045-29b9-4c51-a5d8-8d55f0b263b6","uuid":"3f6e87a2-b864-45a8-8bd6-9c517b81be58","timestamp":"2026-10-16T23:11:06.484Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Y Combinator most recent batch companies list AI startups","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_015Et9S5wZimqwSUU4J7Qfnw","content":[{"title":"getcoai.com","url":"https://getcoai.com/?p=86274"},{"title":"CO/AI Subscribe","url":"https://getcoai.com/news/eggs-basket-y-combinators-summer-2025-batch-hits-record-with-nearly-100-ai-focus/"},{"title":"about.getcoai.com","url":"https://about.getcoai.com/?p=86274"},{"title":"Artificial intelligence Startups Venture","url":"https://news.crunchbase.com/venture/y-combinator-winter-2023-shift-ai-devtools-b2b/"},{"title":"What Y Combinator Is Funding in 2026: A Data Breakdown of 208 Startups","url":"https://pinggy.io/amp/blog/what_yc_is_funding_in_2026/"},{"title":"tags.getcoai.com","url":"https://tags.getcoai.com/?p=86274"},{"title":"what yc is funding in 2026","url":"https://pinggy.io/blog/what_yc_is_funding_in_2026/"},{"title":"three quarters of founders in the latest y combinator cohort are working on","url":"https://www.sherwood.news/tech/three-quarters-of-founders-in-the-latest-y-combinator-cohort-are-working-on/"},{"title":"ai startups now represent 75 of y combinators summer 2024 cohort","url":"https://getcoai.com/news/ai-startups-now-represent-75-of-y-combinators-summer-2024-cohort"},{"title":"ww.getcoai.com","url":"https://ww.getcoai.com/?p=86274"}]},"The most recent data I found is a August 11, 